title: "DDA-BNN v1.0: A Morphology-Aware Surrogate Model for the Optical Properties of Black Carbon–Containing Particles"
version: 1.0.2
type: software
license: BSD-2-Clause
repository-code: "https://github.com/pnnl/DDA-BNN"
abstract: >-
  DDA-BNN is a morphology-aware Bayesian neural network surrogate for
  predicting the optical properties of black carbon-containing particles
  and quantifying aleatoric and epistemic uncertainty.
